  <ol>
    <li>Fetches the item JSON.</li>
    <li>Follows <code>registryDependencies</code> — most components pull in <code>utils</code>.</li>
    <li>Installs each entry in <code>dependencies</code> with your project's package manager.</li>
    <li>Writes every file to its <code>target</code> path.</li>
  </ol>

  <p><strong>Useful options:</strong></p>

